---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  const jobPages = [
    {
      id: 'government',
      title: 'Government Jobs (Govt Jobs)',
      content: `
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">Current Major Government Recruitments</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-slate-600" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">Getting a government job in Maharashtra and Central Government is a dream for many. The following major departments frequently have recruitment openings:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i></span> 
            <div><strong>MPSC (Maharashtra Public Service Commission):</strong> Recruitment for officer positions through State Service and Combined Pre-Examination (Group B & C).</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i></span> 
            <div><strong>Maharashtra Police Recruitment:</strong> Annual large-scale recruitment for constables, drivers, and SRPF positions.</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i></span> 
            <div><strong>Zilla Parishad:</strong> Mega recruitment for health workers, gram sevaks, and clerk positions.</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="w-full min-h-[250px] bg-slate-50 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-slate-400 text-sm">
          Ad Space
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">How to Prepare for Exams?</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-slate-600" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">Consistency and proper guidance are needed to get a government job. Understand the syllabus well, solve previous year question papers, and keep up with current affairs.</p>
        <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-indigo-800 mb-2 text-lg">Are you eligible for recruitment?</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-indigo-600 mb-4">Check your exact age (years, months, days) for government recruitment.</p>
          <a href="/en/tools/age-calculator" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold py-2 px-6 rounded-lg hover:brightness-110 transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-md">Use Age Calculator</a>
        </div>
      `
    },
    {
      id: 'skills',
      title: 'Skill Development Training',
      content: `
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">Free Government Training Schemes</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-slate-600" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">In today's world, just a degree is not enough; you need the right skills. The government runs many free training schemes for youth.</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i> PMKVY</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600" style="line-height: 1.5;">Under the Pradhan Mantri Kaushal Vikas Yojana, youth receive free industry-related skill training. Certificate and job placement assistance is provided after course completion.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> Pramod Mahajan Yojana</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600" style="line-height: 1.5;">This Maharashtra Government scheme provides employment-oriented training to youth in the state, helping them get jobs or start their own businesses.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">Where to Register?</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-slate-600" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">You can register on the <strong>Mahaswayam</strong> portal and get information about training centers near you.</p>
      `
    },
    {
      id: 'resume-guide',
      title: 'How to Build a Resume?',
      content: `
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">Why is an Effective Resume Important?</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-slate-600" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">Your resume is your first impression when applying for any private company job. A good resume gets you an interview opportunity.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">Your resume must include:</h3>
        <ul class="pl-5 space-y-3 mb-8 text-slate-700" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          <li style="list-style-type: disc;"><strong>Contact Info:</strong> Your accurate mobile number and professional email ID.</li>
          <li style="list-style-type: disc;"><strong>Career Objective:</strong> What type of job you are looking for and how you will contribute to the company's growth.</li>
          <li style="list-style-type: disc;"><strong>Education:</strong> Your degree, college name, and passing year (in reverse order - most recent first).</li>
          <li style="list-style-type: disc;"><strong>Skills:</strong> Technical skills (e.g., MS Excel, Tally, Coding) and soft skills (e.g., Communication, Teamwork).</li>
          <li style="list-style-type: disc;"><strong>Experience:</strong> If you are not a fresher, mention your previous work experience and responsibilities.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="w-full min-h-[250px] bg-slate-50 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-slate-400 text-sm">
          Ad Space
        </div>
      `
    },
    {
      id: 'freelance',
      title: 'Freelancing Guide',
      content: `
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">What is Freelancing?</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-slate-600" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">Freelancing means instead of working a 9-to-5 job at a company, you use your skills to work for different people through the internet and earn money.</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">How to Earn Through Freelancing?</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl">
             <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">1. Choose a Skill</h4>
             <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-slate-700" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">First decide what you're good at. E.g., Graphic Designing, Video Editing, Content Writing, or Web Development.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl">
             <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">2. Create a Profile</h4>
             <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-slate-700" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">Create a free account and profile on international websites like Upwork, Fiverr, or Freelancer.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl">
             <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">3. Build a Portfolio</h4>
             <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-slate-700" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">Collect samples of your previous work to show clients and upload them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-indigo-800 mb-2 text-lg">Want to Start a Business?</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-indigo-600 mb-4">If you want to start your own online business, read about government loan schemes.</p>
          <a href="/en/business/loans" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold py-2 px-6 rounded-lg hover:brightness-110 transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-md">View Business Loan Schemes</a>
        </div>
      `
    }
  ];

  return jobPages.map(page => ({
    params: { id: page.id },
    props: { page },
  }));
}

const { page } = Astro.props;
---

<Layout title={`${page.title} | Jobs | MahitiMarg`}>
    <main class="container py-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto" style="min-height: 80vh;">
        <div class="mb-6 animate-on-load">
            <a href="/en/jobs" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-medium hover:underline transition-colors" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Jobs Hub
            </a>
        </div>
        <article class="glass-panel animate-on-scroll shadow-md" style="padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);">
            <header style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <h1 class="title-gradient" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;">{page.title}</h1>
            </header>
            <div set:html={page.content} class="article-content scheme-detail" style="font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;" />
        </article>
    </main>
</Layout>
